Warhammer Survivors Out Now on XBOX Game Pass! Defeat the Gloomspite Gitz With These Tips
Big news – Warhammer Survivors is out now!&nbsp;
If this is your first time hearing about Warhammer Survivors , buckle in for addictive bullet-heaven survivor gameplay set across the battlefields of the 41st Millennium and the Mortal Realms. You might know us, Auroch Digital, from our other Warhammer game, Warhammer 40,000 Boltgun . We’ve teamed up with poncle and Warhammer to create an officially licensed Warhammer Survivors .&nbsp;
We’ve had great fun creating the sprites and animations of the fungus-addled Gloomspite Gitz. Warhammer Survivors has been a passion project for us, and we can’t wait to get the game into your hands!&nbsp;
Warhammer Survivors is out now!
Warhammer Survivors is available right now on XBOX Series X|S and available on XBOX Game Pass.
